Pharo: Pango 1.58.2 in Pharo's WebAssembly VM, which has no threads (the
fontconfig thread of PangoFcFontMap: its work is done when it is queued)
and traps on a call through a function pointer of another type (the
interface init functions of G_IMPLEMENT_INTERFACE, which take two
arguments with the GLib patch 0001-wasm-vips.patch; free and copy
functions called through a GFunc or a GCopyFunc).

